			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "8NxnkijD1oQp0BENkSuEd",
			"originalText": "Microservices Architecture\n\nIndependent, small services with their own DBs\n\nScalable, team-friendly, but complex\n\nExample: Netflix, Amazon",
